        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Copyright Office and numerous Internet domain names, including “williams-sonoma.com,” “potterybarn.com,” “potterybarnkids.com,” “potterybarnteen.com,” “westelm.com,” “wshome.com,” “williams-sonomainc.com,” “rejuvenation.com,” “markandgraham.com” and “greenrow.com.” We also own numerous trade dress rights, trade secrets and other legal rights to our proprietary designs, product packaging, catalogs, website designs, e-commerce technologies and store designs, among other things.",
